WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.350
Every property comes from a particle feature.

2
00:00:03.876 --> 00:00:07.151
Here is a syringe of air. Push the plunger.

3
00:00:12.643 --> 00:00:17.068
Air squashes, because there is lots of empty space between its particles.

4
00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:27.305
Water barely squashes: its particles are already close together.
